        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.22.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 22:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon ocako geto Ot pa Rwoth i Yerusalem wi got Moria, kama Rwoth oyido omenyere iye ri bamere Daudi, i kabedo ma Daudi oyido oyiko, i kasia pa Arauna Jayebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon ocako geto k'ario i dwe mar'ario i oro mar'aŋwen ma dhum pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a rapim pa Solomon ma geto Ot pa Were: Mita 27 i boro, mita abuŋwen i laco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisika ma dhiot oyido rom gi laco ma Ot pa Were gibe, mita abuŋwen, kodi ŋawirok mita piero abic g'aŋwen. Iy kisika oyido oum gi zahabu macil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisika madwoŋ oyido otim gi sida t'iumo gi zahabu macil, to jotim'iye cal ma thith kodi lijegere ma loko maŋon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere oyiko Ot pa Were maŋon gi telin ma welo kodi zahabu m'oom wok i Parvayim ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno kere oumo ot gi zahabu, kore, wiye, kodi thigo to goro cal ma cwec ma jobwombi gin i kore ot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
